# Dyrroth, Prince of the Abyss

> Dyrroth is not a brawler. He is a tempo fighter who lives or dies on the short Abyss Enhanced window that opens when his Rage hits 50%, and since his 2.1.67 rework ([patch notes](/patch-notes)) that Rage regenerates passively every second. The draft question is no longer "can he trade into Rage" but "can the enemy team deny his new S1-priority lane before he snowballs."

