## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Pickoff Default (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Sky Piercer, Sea Halberd, Immortality
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Sky Piercer
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when crowd control is light and the first two waves are decided by armor trades.; Malefic Roar over Sea Halberd when Use when the priority target is stacking Physical Defense instead of relying on shield, HP regen, or high extra HP.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use only when ahead and closing, before late Lord fights make one death more expensive than extra damage.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst when the Lifeline shield saves the first entry better than a delayed revive.
- Total cost: 10330 gold

Default EXP setup for Dyrroth games where he plays fog-of-war pickoffs, arms Heptaseas, and converts one isolated target into Sky Piercer stacks.

### EXP Sustain Bruiser (EXP)

